OL,3,GNEWSAVoting to begin in general
OL,4,Aelection
OL,5,
OL,6,FVoting is set to begin in the 2026 Isle
OL,7,Fof Man general election.
OL,9,FPolling stations across the island open
OL,10,Fat 08:00 BST, with voters having until
OL,11,F20:00 to cast their votes.
OL,13,FVoters will elect 24 members of the
OL,14,FHouse of Keys, two in each of the 12
OL,15,Fconstituencies, who will serve in Manx
OL,16,Fparliament for the next five years.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
